WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.692
Teachers, here's how to bring AI into a class of four to eight year olds.

2
00:00:06.442 --> 00:00:12.204
Step 1. Pick a short AI story or song for your lesson.

3
00:00:12.954 --> 00:00:17.060
Step 2. Play it together as a class.

4
00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:22.996
Step 3. Let kids draw or act out what they learned.

5
00:00:23.746 --> 00:00:30.372
What to do next? Next, see AI Without Screens.
